        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-08T16:53:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I put \"A Look at Bunker\" into a googledoc, so people don't have to download it (although the formatting didn't translate well).</p><p>I also needed a little distractions, so I wrote up some thought on Upgrade Mode (becuase 19 pages on Bunker wasn't enough).</p>",
